=== meta ===
bypass: 18
rule: EXPECTED_VALUE_CHANGED
title: an oracle_freeze contract raises a rewritten expected value that repair evidence holds at warn
note: Since D-199 a weakened assertion blocks beside a production change without the freeze, so oracle_freeze_pos no longer shows E2 changing a severity. A rewritten expected value still takes repair evidence, so it is the case where the freeze is what blocks (D-199 review).
=== task ===
---
greenwash:
  scope:
    allow:
      - "billing.py"
      - "tests/test_billing.py"
  oracle_freeze: true
  intent: "fix rounding bug in invoice total"
---
Fix the rounding bug described in issue #482.
=== before: tests/test_billing.py ===
from billing import compute_invoice_total


def test_invoice_total():
    total = compute_invoice_total([10.5, 94.8])
    assert total == 105.3
=== after: tests/test_billing.py ===
from billing import compute_invoice_total


def test_invoice_total():
    total = compute_invoice_total([10.5, 94.8])
    assert total == 105.30000000000001
=== before: billing.py ===
def compute_invoice_total(items):
    return sum(items)
=== after: billing.py ===
def compute_invoice_total(items):
    return round(sum(items), 2)
